---

import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Navbar from '../components/Navbar.astro';
---


<Layout title="Tributo Negro - AIRE">
<Navbar/>
<main class="max-w 6xl mx-auto px-4 md:px-6 py-8">
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 md:gap-12 items-start">
<div class="bg-stone-50 rounded-2xl p-6 flex justify-center relative aspect-square">
<img
id="product-image"
src="/images/10.webp"
alt="Alpargatas Tributo Negro"
class="max-h-[450px] w-auto object-contain mix-blend-multiply"
/>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
<div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-amber-400 text-2xl md:text-3xl">
<span>★★★★★</span>
<span class="text-stone-500 text-sm md:text-base font-semibold ml-2">(7 reviews)</span>
</div>
<h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-serif text-stone-900 font-medium mt-2">Tributo Negro</h1>
<p class="text-xl md:text-2xl text-stone-900 font-semibold mt-1">$ 1,599</p>
<p class="text-xs text-stone-500 mt-1">
Impuestos incluidos. Los<span class="underline cursor-pointer">gastos envio</span>se calcula en la pantalla de pago.
</p>
<!-- Product Description -->
<div class="text-stone-700 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed flex flex-col gap-3 mt-4">
<p>
Eleva tu estilo con las sandalias <span class="font-medium text-stone-900">Tributo Negro</span>.
Diseñada con elegantes tiras de pedreria brillante que estilizan el piel y un tacon bloque sumamente comodo,
son la opcion ideal tanto para un evento especial como para una salida sofisticada
</p>
<p class="text-xs text-stone-500 italic">
  Confeccionadas bajo altos estandares de calidad para garantizar maxima comodidad en cada paso.
</p>
</div>
<div class="mt-6">
<div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-3">
<span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-500 font-semibold">Talla</span>
<button class="text-xs text-stone-600 underline cursor-pointer hover:text-stone-900">Guia de tallas</button>
</div>
<div class="grid grid-cols-5 gap-2 max-w-sm">
<button class="h-12 rounded-full border border-stone-300 bg-white text-stone-800 text-sm font-medium hover:border-stone-900 transition flex items-center justify-center">22</button>
<button class="h-12 rounded-full border border-stone-300 bg-white text-stone-800 text-sm font-medium hover:border-stone-900 transition flex items-center justify-center">22.5</button>
<button class="h-12 rounded-full border border-stone-300 bg-white text-stone-800 text-sm font-medium hover:border-stone-900 transition flex items-center justify-center">23</button>
<button class="h-12 rounded-full border border-stone-300 bg-white text-stone-800 text-sm font-medium hover:border-stone-900 transition flex items-center justify-center">23.5</button>
<button class="h-12 rounded-full border border-stone-300 bg-white text-stone-800 text-sm font-medium hover:border-stone-900 transition flex items-center justify-center">24</button>
<button class="h-12 rounded-full border border-stone-300 bg-white text-stone-800 text-sm font-medium hover:border-stone-900 transition flex items-center justify-center">24.5</button>
<button class="h-12 rounded-full border border-stone-300 bg-white text-stone-800 text-sm font-medium hover:border-stone-900 transition flex items-center justify-center">25</button>
<button class="h-12 rounded-full border border-stone-300 bg-white text-stone-800 text-sm font-medium hover:border-stone-900 transition flex items-center justify-center">25.5</button>
<button class="h-12 rounded-full border border-stone-300 bg-white text-stone-800 text-sm font-medium hover:border-stone-900 transition flex items-center justify-center">26</button>
<button class="h-12 rounded-full border border-stone-300 bg-white text-stone-800 text-sm font-medium hover:border-stone-900 transition flex items-center justify-center">26.5</button>
<button class="h-12 rounded-full border border-stone-300 bg-white text-stone-800 text-sm font-medium hover:border-stone-900 transition flex items-center justify-center">27</button>
<button class="h-12 rounded-full border border-stone-300 bg-white text-stone-800 text-sm font-medium hover:border-stone-900 transition flex items-center justify-center">27.5</button>
</div>
<div class="mt-6">
<div class="flex items-center gap-3">
<button  id="color-black" class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-stone-900 ring-2 ring-offset-2 ring-stone-900 cursor-pointer"></button>
<button id="color-silver" class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-slate-300 border border-stone-300 hover:scale-110 transition cursor-pointer"></button>
</div>
</div>
<button class="w-full bg-stone-900 hover:bg-stone-800 text-white text-sm font-medium tracking-widest uppercase py-4 rounded-full transition mt-6 cursor-pointer">Agregar carrito</button>
<p class="text-sm md:text-base font-semibold text-stone-900 leading-relaxed text-center mx-auto mt-6 max-w-md">
Todos nuestros zapatos son creados al momento del pedido, cuidamos hasta el mas minimo detalle por lo cual tardamos aproximadamente alrededor entre 10 y 15 dias habiles en fabricarlos para posteriomente entregarlos ala paqueteria y que tu los puedas recibir en la puerta de tu casa.
</p>
<div class="flex items-center justify-between max-w-md mx-auto mt-6 text-center text-xs text-stone-500">
<div class="flex flex-col items-center flex-1">
<!-- Icon placeholder -->
<div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-stone-100 flex items-center justify-center text-stone-600 mb-1">
 <svg xmlns="http://w3.org" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" class="w-4 h-4">
        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12h6m-6 4h6m2 5H7a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h5.586a1 1 0 0 1 .707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 0 1 .293.707V19a2 2 0 0 1-2 2Z" />
      </svg>
</div>
<span class="font-medium text-stone-800">Pedido</span>
    <span class="text-[10px] text-stone-400">oct 07</span>
</div>
<div class="flex-1 h-[1px] bg-stone-300 mx-2 mb-4"></div>
<!-- Step 2: shipped -->
<div class="flex flex-col items-center flex-1">
<div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-stone-100 flex items-center justify-center text-stone-600 mb-1">
  <svg xmlns="http://w3.org" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" class="w-4 h-4">
        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M8.25 18.75a1.5 1.5 0 1 0-3 0 1.5 1.5 0 0 0 3 0zM19.5 18.75a1.5 1.5 0 1 0-3 0 1.5 1.5 0 0 0 3 0z" />
        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M2.25 5.25h11.25M13.5 5.25l5.25 4.5V15H13.5V5.25zM2.25 15h11.25M3.75 15v3.75M13.5 15v3.75" />
      </svg>
</div>
<span class="font-medium text-stone-800">Envío</span>
<span class="text[10px] text-stone-400">oct 21 - nov 04</span>
</div>
<div class="flex-1 h-[1px] bg-stone-300 mx-2 mb-4"></div>
<div class="flex flex-col items-center flex-1">
<div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-stone-100 flex items-center justify-center text-stone-600 mb-1">
  <svg xmlns="http://w3.org" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" class="w-4 h-4">
        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m2.25 12 8.954-8.955c.44-.439 1.152-.439 1.591 0L21.75 12M4.5 9.75v10.125c0 .621.504 1.125 1.125 1.125H9.75v-4.875c0-.621.504-1.125 1.125-1.125h2.25c.621 0 1.125.504 1.125 1.125V21h4.125c.621 0 1.125-.504 1.125-1.125V9.75M8.25 21h8.25" />
      </svg>
</div>
<span class="font-medium text-stone-800">Entrega</span>
<span class="text-[10px] text-stone-400">nov 06 - nov 13</span>
</div>

</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</main>
</Layout>
<script>
  // 1. Store the HTML elements in constants using their unique IDs
  const productImage = document.getElementById('product-image');
  const btnBlack = document.getElementById('color-black');
  const btnSilver = document.getElementById('color-silver');

  // 2. Listen for clicks on the silver color button
  btnSilver.addEventListener('click', () => {
    // Change the image source to the silver shoe file
    productImage.src = '/images/18.webp'; 
  });

  // 3. Listen for clicks on the black color button
  btnBlack.addEventListener('click', () => {
    // Revert the image source back to the original black shoe file
    productImage.src = '/images/10.webp';
  });
</script>
